{"id":"649623","name":"玉米面红糖馅煎饼","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/649623/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"玉米面自发粉","amount":"250g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"红糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"20g"},{"name":"温开水","amount":"300ml"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"玉米面自发粉，也可以自行发面。","img":"images/649623/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"红糖、鸡蛋。","img":"images/649623/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"玉米面内打入两个鸡蛋，加入20克白糖。","img":"images/649623/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入300ml的温开水","img":"images/649623/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅拌至无颗粒。","img":"images/649623/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上保鲜膜，发酵30分钟。","img":"images/649623/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"面发好了，搅拌排气。","img":"images/649623/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煎锅里均匀的刷上油，最好用平底锅。","img":"images/649623/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入面糊，全程用小火。","img":"images/649623/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"表面撒上红糖，糖的量随自己喜好，喜欢甜可以多放些。","img":"images/649623/step_10.jpeg"},{"step":11,"desc":"对折，两面再煎上两分钟即可。","img":"images/649623/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"切块。","img":"images/649623/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。香甜松软，味道挺赞！","img":"images/649623/step_13.jpeg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他、不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}